  "strings": [
    "Now the darkness falls upon Gondor...\u0000",
    "and Minas Tirith is encircled by a ring of iron-shod malice.\u0000",
    "Great siege towers lumber toward the beleaguered walls.\u0000",
    "Each burdened with a deadly Orc horde.\u0000",
    "Upon the main gate the Dark Lord unleashes Grond...\u0000",
    "a terrible battering ram of wolf-like wrath.\u0000",
    "For hope of victory\u0000",
    "Gondor's warriors must hold each ring of their city\u0000",
    "for as long as they are able...\u0000",
    "before retreating deeper within their burning citadel.\u0000"
  ]
